                    "title": "",
                    "text": "Can a valley come back to life because of one dropped acorn? 🌱\n\nTHE CYCLE is my dialogue-free animated short for the Higgsfield Talent Contest. As the valley recovers, the sound shifts from wind and rustling plastic to birds and running water.\n\nIf you watch, I’d love to hear which moment made the valley feel alive again. Please leave your thoughts on the film’s project page, and tap the heart there if it stayed with you.",
